cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GeneLab in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "GeneLab: An Isaac Lab–style API for RL & robotics research on Genesis"
abstract: >-
  GeneLab is a manager-based reinforcement-learning research scaffold for the
  Genesis simulator, shaped to mirror Isaac Lab's API but lightweight (no
  USD/Kit, no NVIDIA lock-in). It ships registered robots/environments/tasks,
  manager-based MDP configs, a Typer CLI, and three RL backends (rsl_rl, skrl,
  stable_baselines3).
type: software
authors:
